{"id":"wb-6-548","name":"芝堰村建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芝堰村建筑群","text":"芝堰村建筑群位于浙江省金华兰溪市黄店镇的芝堰村，距新叶村不到4千米。\n该村始建于南宋，现存明清建筑六十六座，以明代为主，占地2.5万平方米，其中代表性建筑有衍德堂、孝思堂、济美堂、成志堂、承显堂、光裕堂、善述堂、世德堂、世泽堂、楼上厅、荣褒五代、斗室乾坤、积厚流光等，分为宗祠和民居两大类。\n2009年，国家文物局通过了“民宅翻建”的立项批复。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%9D%E5%A0%B0%E6%9D%91%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":84935910,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84935910","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/21f91feb19bf340eff51d7be.jpg","title":"Banyue_Pond_in_Zhiyan_Village_03_2014-10.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banyue_Pond_in_Zhiyan_Village_03_2014-10.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Banyue_Pond_in_Zhiyan_Village_03_2014-10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​芝堰村，半月塘。","width":320,"height":213}}